file construction/CHECKPOINTS.md the walk-back cairn, recorded before the card was swept
file session-logs/date/README-index-20260906.md the day shelf, born with this lap
recommend kg -- the audit is written and the find is named where its owners will read it; the next bounded lap in my lane is the meter this reading leaves behind, one shell pipeline holding the differing count at five so a sixth reds the lap it arrives, though a tree-wide structural guard may sit closer to bakery's friction lane than to mine.
